{"id":1562,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为深入落实高校“访企拓岗”促就业专项行动工作要求，持续拓宽毕业生就业渠道，深化校企联动、夯实校友资源纽带，7月15日至16日，机械工程学院学生工作办公室主任王子威带队，组织学院学生赴深圳开展暑期“访企拓岗”专项走访活动，先后走进深圳创想三维科技股份有限公司、深圳铭威智能科技发展有限公司两家企业开展调研交流。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6ozL_bMRlYMzGZUF4WRUlr2nzTRLR697nNLbLNCaMlM2M8C0gihFp2hmCIa0USy8oShRUYyaUzf7M77iU8rfMm7io7LPnl-ZUNCZLz9aM4VFnNC4ozNDolnFLm6fL4UJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A49CC0A0D4A5CEA6158C1EB8BF818071/FF39969D/27A34\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 200px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6M4r_Ro7MkoR9inFzLDoRrfLmCaL4L9iU4CPMRvsU4LZU4N0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybL1yDnky8nRrfn7-8nmQ7U4-Dnz7bMz-PL8Uinz7YnmMFolrfMRvPnRAFolr2M7lJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\">&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6U8L_YoRLDLlrRMF4rfnRLPMR-iM4-9anmCbMl-anNrRU8l0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy8n1y8MShknz7YLzlio7Wfo7-aL4T2LR6fM4UiMzf2nNWFMNLDnlM2oRQFMRGZUl7Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/54F45BE121558BA8B039F07A74550FFB/6C6ECF86/408AA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 355px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6nm-_aolCaLzLbLF4CDMmGao7UaMNC9PM8C4Lz-boz98nl70gihFp2hmCIa0UYh2UYhVUYyYL87DnzAfUl-ZMRrfMmNiUNliU4C8L4GDL4nFL7lYLl78L7WFnmNbUN-Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\">&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6M8n_fU49PLNL4oF7-ZMm7bLzW2oR69kLl7aMz-Ynmf2LzN0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkM1hkokyPL4GYMlnkU4U8L7-sMR-4nlC8o7-sozr2M7nFL774n7MkM7MFM4fRoRUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DB6B813025DBC440B7423EF48B795F4D/0A3DCB4C/70C84\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 200px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6L4r_2nz9iollPnFR74nRfVnmGaU8l9DUlV7M8-sU494nRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhVnkh7LShkolrkM4VkMlV2MRvsM7l8nlLanRWVMll4M4AFL8CYMzG8nz6FLmrVnRVVgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4oz9aMYbw62A8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在深圳创想三维科技股份有限公司走访期间，师生们与公司接待负责人胡杨进行了座谈交流，详细了解了桌面级FDM 3D打印技术的最新发展动态及其在医疗、航空航天等领域的多元应用，并就校企联合建设社团进行深入交流。随后，师生一行深入企业生产现场实地参观，近距离观摩了3D打印设备的研发制造流程。此次走访的深圳铭威智能科技发展有限公司，为学院2002级校友王芦华创办企业。走访期间，王子威老师带领学生实地参观金属注塑成型自动化生产线，系统了解注塑成型的完整工艺流程、核心技术要点及行业技术特色。在座谈交流环节，校友王芦华深情追忆在校求学时光，真诚分享个人创业历程、行业从业经验与行业发展见解，并主动表示将充分发挥自身资源与专业优势，为学院学生学科竞赛、专业实践提供全方位的专业指导与技术支持。王子威老师代表学院对校友的鼎力支持表示衷心感谢，并希望校企双方持续深化沟通对接，拓展合作领域、夯实合作基础，构建长效合作机制。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6LzV_VLRCbM4U8oFl-PL4NZMmQ2L4V92L7CPMz9iU8-boR-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyZMYhfLShRL4AfoRUbMm7aoRGPnR7bMmUPL8-aM7V2M8MFoRUbUzC4ozWFLlMfMm9Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/987A1C38A849610801D196413B04AF7C/849A6392/1CA68\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 200px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6LzV_VLRCbM4U8oFl-PL4NZMmQ2L4V92L7CPMz9iU8-boR-0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyZMYhfLShRL4AfoRUbMm7aoRGPnR7bMmUPL8-aM7V2M8MFoRUbUzC4ozWFLlMfMm9Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\">&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6ozM_fUlCPLz7bMF7r7Ll-inz62o779aLNlZUm9ZLNnRMmG0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyDUSyPLkysUznfLRT2LRWRMzVVU8C4M7-sUllsUzf2M8QFM8LiU4ffLlnFU4NYM4CJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/16A107A4A09F02C51ECF34B7AE7A0F7F/7C5C0A1D/C9276\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 328px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6nzC_DnzA2UlW2nFz74LmfVLN7sM469knRGDnN-aLmvPMR70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyYnkyankhfL4M7U8lZL7LaMzUYn7W2LRQkM462LllsnmTFUNM7Lm74M7MFLmQVLRrRgjfJQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4oz9aMYbw62A8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.png\">&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6M7U_ioRv8M8VRLFR9aUl-bnRAkn7V97MNlaMR9ZMRC8Umv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVU1yYoShVol-bU4UsM4lbozU4M7VkLzLinzW7UzCPMmMFLR-8MmW2nlrFLlr2oRvJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BEB29E9B9C477599434AB135E2DA6163/02462FEE/1EF87\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 200px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6Um-_8MNl4U47PLFzWRoRGPMzL4o7W9VM7r2LmA7UlW2MmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyaM1h2nSysU4-ioR9sM49PL8rkMN-8oRTfU4lPUNUPMmTFM7UPL7n2LmQFoRUPLm7Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次访企拓岗活动，不仅精准对接了行业前沿技术与企业用人需求，也为推进学院毕业生就业搜集了直接信息<a href=\"https://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/info/1817/25649.htm\"></a>。下一步，机械工程学院将常态化、全覆盖推进“访企拓岗”工作，持续整合优质校企资源，深化产教融合、校企协同育人，推动校企合作走深走实，全方位为毕业生搭建高质量就业平台、拓宽就业渠道，助力学院学生实现更高质量、更充分就业。</p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6ozL_bMRlYMzGZUF4WRUlr2nzTRLR697nNLbLNCaMlM2M8C0gihFp2hmCIa0USy8oShRUYyaUzf7M77iU8rfMm7io7LPnl-ZUNCZLz9aM4VFnNC4ozNDolnFLm6fL4UJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LboRGsgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=39807&e=.jpg"}